From cc6f26710adad87861364c8ef148b70a1d7bae21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Steinhart <ssteinhart@student.tgm.ac.at>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:07:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] mo2947-camera: USB drive, webcam and USB microphone modes

UP cycles the USB mode: debug link (1908:3319) -> mass storage with the SD card
writable (1908:3318) -> webcam (UVC MJPEG 640x480/320x240) + USB microphone
(UAC, 32 kHz) + SD card read-only (1908:3317) -> debug link. The webcam
pipeline comes from examples/uvc-camera (webcam.inc, statistics removed).

2 MiB does not hold the camera app's buffers and the webcam's at once, and
they never run together: linker/mo2947.ld places the webcam buffers (.uvc_ws)
over .jpeg_buffer. That needs --no-check-sections for this board's link; the
script's asserts replace the overlap check (section order, RAM end below the
stack).

Verified on the device 2026-11-12: drive mounts and the files open, webcam
picture in a host camera app, USB microphone records, back to the preview.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Makefile                           |   5 +-
 examples/mo2947-camera/features.mk |   3 +
 examples/mo2947-camera/main.c      | 113 ++++++++--
 examples/mo2947-camera/webcam.inc  | 332 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 linker/mo2947.ld                   |   9 +-
 5 files changed, 443 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 examples/mo2947-camera/features.mk
 create mode 100644 examples/mo2947-camera/webcam.inc

